      "Q": {
        "slot": "Q",
        "id": "QiyanaQ",
        "name": "元素之怒 / 以绪塔尔之锋",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "奇亚娜挥舞她的武器，造成伤害和基于她元素的额外效果。",
        "bodyHtml": "如果奇亚娜并未拥有一个<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">附魔</span>，那么她会进行斩击，对小范围内的敌人们造成<span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(80/110/140/170/200 + (90% 额外攻击力))物理伤害</span>。如果她已有一个<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">附魔</span>，那么这个技能会获得额外距离并基于<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">附魔</span>类型获得一个额外效果：<span><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">寒冰附魔</span>：暂时<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">禁锢</span>，然后是持续1秒的20%<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">减速</span>。<span><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">岩石附魔</span>：对低于50%生命值的敌人们造成额外的<span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(48/66/84/102/120 + (54% 额外攻击力))物理伤害</span>。<span><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">荒野附魔</span>：留下一条小径，来使奇亚娜<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 font-semibold\">隐形</span>并提供<span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">20%移动速度</span>。<br /><br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">第一个之后的敌人转而受到<span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">75%物理伤害</span>。<br />这个技能对野怪造成160%伤害。<br /><span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 font-semibold\">隐形</span>单位只会被【防御塔】或<span style=\"color: #ee91d7\">真实视野</font color>显形。</span>",
        "iconFile": "QiyanaQ.png",
